 2003.1   1    angle-pentic     -7e-07                              Pentic angle coefficient (1/degree^3)
 2003.1   1    angle-sextic     2.2e-08                             Sextic angle coefficient (1/degree^4)
 2003.1   1    opbendtype       ALLINGER                            Out-of-plane angle definition (ALLINGER or W-D-C)
 2003.1   1    opbend-cubic     -0.014                              Cubic out-of-plane coefficient (1/degree)
 2003.1   1    opbend-quartic   5.6e-05                             Quartic out-of-plane coefficient (1/degree^2)
 2003.1   1    opbend-pentic    -7e-07                              Pentic out-of-plane coefficient (1/degree^3)
 2003.1   1    opbend-sextic    2.2e-08                             Sextic out-of-plane coefficient (1/degree^4)
 2003.1   1    torsionunit      0.5                                 Factor the Tinker torsion amplitudes were multiplied by
 2003.1   1    pitorsunit       1.0                                 Factor the Tinker pi-torsion amplitudes were multiplied by
 2003.1   1    tortorunit       1.0                                 Factor the Tinker torsion-torsion grids were multiplied by
 2003.1   1    vdwtype          BUFFERED-14-7                       Van der Waals functional form
 2003.1   1    radiusrule       CUBIC-MEAN                          Combining rule of the minimum distance
 2003.1   1    radiustype       R-MIN                               Meaning of the size parameter
 2003.1   1    radiussize       DIAMETER                            Radius or diameter
 2003.1   1    epsilonrule      HHG                                 Combining rule of the well depth
 2003.1   1    delta-halgren    0.07                                Buffering constant delta of the 14-7 form
 2003.1   1    gamma-halgren    0.12                                Buffering constant gamma of the 14-7 form
 2003.1   1    dielectric       1.0                                 Dielectric constant
 2003.1   1    polarization     MUTUAL                              Induced dipole model (MUTUAL or DIRECT)
 2003.1   1    d-equals-p       false                               Use one set of induced dipoles for energy and gradient (HIPPO)
